        tx duration:    0 us
        rx bitrate:     1801.4 MBit/s 80MHz EHT-MCS 11 EHT-NSS 3 EHT-GI 0
        rx duration:    0 us

v3:
1.change wmi_vdev_stats_event to wmi_vdev_stats_params

v2:
